  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{話|はな}す (speak X) / X⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{話|はな}す (talk with X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing action. {話|はな}している = 'is talking.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・⟦{日本語|にほんご}→日本語：00614_nihongo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{話|はな}す (speak Japanese)\n・⟦{友達|ともだち}→友達：01478_tomodachi⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{話|はな}す (talk with friend)\n・⟦{電話|でんわ}→電話：01471_denwa⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{話|はな}す (talk on phone)\n・{話|はな}せる (can speak - potential)\n\nFocuses on the act of speaking. Compare: ⟦{言|い}う→言う：00515_iu⟧ (say - focuses on content). Noun: ⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧ (story/conversation).",
